      "translations": [
        "Last year Dad and I went walking in the mountains.",
        "The mountain was high and the path was long. People said it would take five hours.",
        "After three hours I was exhausted and didn't want to go on. I wanted to go home.",
        "Dad took my hand and said: “If we walk together, we'll definitely make it!”",
        "In the end we did it! The view from the top was beautiful, and I was really happy. We ate buns at the top."
